  "date": "2026-10-31",
  "description": "The Corne Cherry v3 keyboard (foostan/crkbd at b473521), left half as published: a SparkFun Pro Micro 5V/16MHz on headers, 21 keys in hot-swap sockets in a 4 × 6 matrix with a diode per key (cathodes to the rows), 21 SK6812MINI-E per-key LEDs and 6 WS2812B underglow LEDs in one chain on VCC, a TRRS jack to the right half, an OLED socket, a reset button. Transcribed for edakit's tests.",
